// ─── Syncthing ignore rules — Film Study Tool / outputs ─────────────────────
//
// Folder ID:  film-study-outputs
// Windows:    C:\Users\vxi\OneDrive\Documents\Film Study Tool\outputs
// macOS:      ~/Documents/Film Study Tool/outputs
//
// ~291 MB: the actual film studies — workbooks, manifests, extracted frames.
// This is the work. data/ is NOT synced (see PORTING.md): it holds 1.7 GB of
// downloaded source video that is re-downloadable and includes ~800 MB of
// duplicates.
//
// ⚠ OneDrive OVERLAP: this folder is inside OneDrive on Windows. Running both
// OneDrive and Syncthing over the same files causes conflict storms. Pick one —
// either exclude "Film Study Tool" from OneDrive (Settings → Account → Choose
// folders), or drop this Syncthing folder and let OneDrive carry it.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

// ── Never sync ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
(?d)__pycache__
*.pyc

// Scratch and logs
*.tmp
*.swp
~$*
.~lock.*
*.log

// Syncthing's own conflict copies — resolve them, do not propagate them
*.sync-conflict-*

// OneDrive placeholder/lock artifacts, if OneDrive is still active here
*.lnk
.tmp.drivedownload

// ── Everything else syncs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Workbooks (.xlsx), manifests (.json/.csv), extracted frames (.jpg),
// per-project film-study folders.
